.Dd November 24, 2026
.Dt MYCELIUM 8
.Os Spore
.Sh NAME
.Nm mycelium
.Nd initialize the Spore full system and supervise services
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The kernel starts Mycelium as
.Pa /sbin/init .
It reads units from
.Pa /etc/mycelium ,
starts the dependencies of
.Pa multi-user.target ,
and supervises the interactive console.
.Pp
Services and oneshot commands can send standard output and standard error
to the journal with
.Cm StandardOutput=journal
and
.Cm StandardError=journal .
The interactive console uses the terminal directly.
.Pp
Use
.Xr myc 1
to inspect units, read logs or request an orderly shutdown.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr myc 1 ,
.Xr msh 1
